.TH batten-receipt-status 1  "batten 0.0.61" 
.SH NAME
batten\-receipt\-status \- Judge the named check\*(Aqs recorded receipt against HEAD and origin/main
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten receipt status\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIcheck\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Judge the named check\*(Aqs recorded receipt against HEAD and origin/main
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIcheck\fR>
The check whose receipt is judged
.SH VERSION
v0.0.61
